    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sereno is a classic puzzle with the simple goal of creating a tile with a purple drink out of tiles with glasses, bottles and ices of various colors. Move all your tiles around the board with the arrow keys. When two tiles of the same color and with the same picture touch, they merge into a new one with the same picture but of the next color of the rainbow. If tiles with a bottle and ices of the same color touch they merge into a tile with a drink of the same color.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft relaxing music that enables player to unwind, rest, and recharge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic tile mechanics: press an arrow to move all the tiles in the direction of the arrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple intuitive rules: it takes less than a minute to master the rules, but the strategic challenges are limitless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth design: clean and satisfying visuals for an enjoyable puzzle experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sereno is perfect for quick relaxing sessions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sereno is a classic puzzle with the simple goal of creating a tile with a purple drink out of tiles with glasses, bottles and ices of various colors. Move all your tiles around the board with the arrow keys. When two tiles of the same color and with the same picture touch, they merge into a new one with the same picture but of the next color of the rainbow. If tiles with a bottle and ices of the same color touch they merge into a tile with a drink of the same color.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft relaxing music that enables player to unwind, rest, and recharge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic tile mechanics: press an arrow to move all the tiles in the direction of the arrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple intuitive rules: it takes less than a minute to master the rules, but the strategic challenges are limitless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth design: clean and satisfying visuals for an enjoyable puzzle experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sereno is perfect for quick relaxing sessions.</p>",
    "short_description": "Sereno is a free relaxing puzzle played on a 4x4 board. A player uses arrow keys to move all the tiles in one of 4 directions. Sometimes a pair of tiles will combine into a new one. Listen to immersive smooth jazz music, lean back, unwind, and give yourself a break you deserve.",
